<p>You transfer up to <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">2, 2, 3, 3, 4</acronym> physical or magical detrimental effects currently affecting you to a nearby creature at a cost of 18 vim per effect.</p><p>Specific effect immunities will not prevent the transfer.</p><p>The chance to transfer each effect increases with your Spellpower.</p>